    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Residential site (c.0.15 acres) in a prime location just minutes from the Main Street of Dunshaughlin Village\r\nThis attractive site offers the perfect setting for the construction of a quality home in one of County Meath’s most sought-after residential locations, ideal for someone wanting to downsize to a manageable \"A\" Rated bungalow or indeed the building of 2 homes each site being €150,000\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\nPrime residential site in an established and desirable location.\r\nWithin easy walking distance of Main Street and village amenities.\r\nAll mains services available in the area, including water, drainage, electricity and telecommunications (subject to the necessary connections and approvals).\r\nExcellent opportunity for owner-occupiers, builders or investors.\r\nConvenient access to the M3 motorway and Dublin City."
      }
